{30}{Well then, welcome to Grayhills @pcname@. As I'm sure you already know, the Mummy has been terrorising our town for several months now. We really do need your help. My people can't sleep at night for worry! All we need is for you to go up into the dark caves outside of town and deal with this threat.}{Well then, welcome to Grayhills @pcname@. As I'm sure you already know, the Mummy has been terrorising our town for several months now. We really do need your help. My people can't sleep at night for worry! All we need is for you to go up into the dark caves outside of town and deal with this threat.}{}{}{}{qu 1400 1}
