{40}{Great! The town will be honoured to have your assistance! I am sure that your long journey by sea has tired you and that you will be needing some rest.  There is an Inn in town called 'The Sleepy Hollow'. It is the finest establishment in town, apart from 'The Rathouse' of course! I suggest you go there to recover from your long trip.}{Great! The town will be honoured to have your assistance! I am sure that your long journey by sea has tired you and that you will be needing some rest.  There is an Inn in town called 'The Sleepy Hollow'. It is the finest establishment in town, apart from 'The Rathouse' of course! I suggest you go there to recover from your long trip.}{}{}{}{qu 1400 2}
