{90}{Ahhh... An adventurous Gnome! You certainly are very unique you know! Most Gnomes I know usually stay indoors all day and count their gold! You must be a rare breed indeed to come here looking for adventure. Personally, I hate dangerous places. That's why I'm the Mayor. Fantastic at organising things I am! When something in Grayhills needs to be done, it's always me they call for! Why, I'm getting carried away with myself again and I don't even know your name!}{Ahhh... An adventurous Gnome! You certainly are very unique you know! Most Gnomes I know usually stay indoors all day and count their gold! You must be a rare breed indeed to come here looking for adventure. Personally, I hate dangerous places. That's why I'm the Mayor. Fantastic at organising things I am! When something in Grayhills needs to be done, it's always me they call for! Why, I'm getting carried away with myself again and I don't even know your name!}{}{}{}{}
