{700}{Here we are @pcname@. May I introduce to you the Treasurer of Grayhills, Mrs Lisa Guiliani. Mrs Guiliani, please welcome to our town the 'Saviour of Grayhills', @pcname@.}{Here we are @pcname@. May I introduce to you the Treasurer of Grayhills, Mrs Lisa Guiliani. Mrs Guiliani, please welcome to our town the 'Saviour of Grayhills', @pcname@.}{}{}{}{}
