{709}{Yeah! Me wan' respekt!}{}{-4}{}{-21}{pv800 130}
{710}{[The Mayor seems troubled.] Oh my, no! We couldn't have that! But err... Mrs Guiliani, if you wouldn't mind, I would like to discuss the small financial matter of compensation for our heroic adventurer here [he indicates you with a nod of his head].}{[The Mayor seems troubled.] Oh my, no! We couldn't have that! But err... Mrs Guiliani, if you wouldn't mind, I would like to discuss the small financial matter of compensation for our heroic adventurer here [he indicates you with a nod of his head].}{}{}{}{}
{711}{Yes, I would like to discuss payment arrangements.}{}{5}{}{-21}{pv800 140}
{712}{Yep! Me want coin!}{}{-4}{}{-21}{pv800 140}
{720}{Reasonable? You would risk your neck for a lousy 200 coin? Mrs Guiliani, surely we can afford a larger payment than that?}{Reasonable? You would risk your neck for a lousy 200 coin? Mrs Guiliani, surely we can afford a larger payment than that?}{}{}{}{}
{721}{[Listen]}{}{1}{}{-21}{pv800 150}
{730}{Of course he hasn't dealt with the Mummy yet! I've only just met @pcname@ at the docks! The small matter of financial compensation was raised and I decided that it was in my... OUR... best interests to arrange some form of payment now, so that our adventurer can have something to look forward to when he's finished his task.}{Of course she hasn't dealt with the Mummy yet! I've only just met @pcname@ at the docks! The small matter of financial compensation was raised and I decided that it was in my... OUR... best interests to arrange some form of payment now, so that our adventurer can have something to look forward to when she's finished her task.}{}{}{}{}
