{770}{Well, I'm glad that we've sorted all of that out. Now, @pcname@, if you would be so kind as to deal with the Mummy. Grayhills has been threatened by it for long enough! Of course, I won't be able to provide you with much assistance as I... Er... Have some very important work to do at.. Umm.. My office. Yes, at my office. So if you'll excuse me...}{Well, I'm glad that we've sorted all of that out. Now, @pcname@, if you would be so kind as to deal with the Mummy. Grayhills has been threatened by it for long enough! Of course, I won't be able to provide you with much assistance as I... Er... Have some very important work to do at.. Umm.. My office. Yes, at my office. So if you'll excuse me...}{}{}{}{}
