{780}{Oh my, yes, there is. A local at the Inn, I forget his name, but he will be able to help you out a bit. He’s up with all the local gossip and knows pretty much everything that’s going on in town here. Unfortunately, I can’t help you out much more than that because as I said, I have some pressing matters to attend to. So, if you’ll excuse me, I’ll leave you now.}{Oh my, yes, there is. A local at the Inn, I forget his name, but he will be able to help you out a bit. He’s up with all the local gossip and knows pretty much everything that’s going on in town here. Unfortunately, I can’t help you out much more than that because as I said, I have some pressing matters to attend to. So, if you’ll excuse me, I’ll leave you now.}{}{}{}{ru 1400}
