{790}{You’ve already dealt with the Mummy @pcname@?!? Incredible! So that’s where you’ve been for the past few days! Here I was waiting patiently for you to arrive so that we could discuss payment and you’ve been off dealing with the Mummy! Why I say, good job!}{You’ve already dealt with the Mummy @pcname@?!? Incredible! So that’s where you’ve been for the past few days! Here I was waiting patiently for you to arrive so that we could discuss payment and you’ve been off dealing with the Mummy! Why I say, good job!}{}{}{}{}
